    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[When Wall of Blossoms enters the battlefield, draw a card.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Quand le Mur de fleurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Cuando el Muro de flores entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Wenn die Blütenmauer ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[Quando il Muro di Bocciuoli entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[花の壁が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[꽃의 벽이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Когда Стена Цветов выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[Quando Barreira de Flores entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[当花丛之墙进战场时，抓一张牌。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[當花叢之牆進戰場時，抽一張牌。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
